  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:07 AM",
      "text": "I got a tip it's done"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:07 AM",
      "text": "Is it done??????"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:55 AM",
      "text": "What's going on"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "12:56 AM",
      "text": "Peanut butter sandwich time"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "12:56 AM",
      "text": "How are guy?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "12:56 AM",
      "text": "you?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:02 AM",
      "text": "Craziness"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:02 AM",
      "text": "Tigers just traded Justin █████████"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:02 AM",
      "text": "Is he going to be available tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "1:04 AM",
      "text": "Right... looking out for you..."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "1:04 AM",
      "text": "Yes, ██ will be available before game one"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "1:04 AM",
      "text": "And we have two games today!!"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:05 AM",
      "text": "No, █████████"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "1:05 AM",
      "text": "Don't know to be honest..."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "1:05 AM",
      "text": "Text Gene Días of the Astros at ████████████"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "1:06 AM",
      "text": "If I know you will know"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:06 AM",
      "text": "Ok thanks"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:56 AM",
      "text": "Never heard back from Dias..."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "7:58 AM",
      "text": "He was reaching out to let us know. We don't believe █████████ will be coming to Comerica Park today. Would guess Astros will do something."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "7:58 AM",
      "text": "Ok"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "1:02 PM",
      "text": "Could I bother you for some background information on how the trade went down, from your vantage point? Writing about that for tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "1:09 PM",
      "text": "Sure"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "5:46 PM",
      "text": "We should reconvene"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:50 PM",
      "text": "Ready and willing"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "5:51 PM",
      "text": "Leaving in a bit, though"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:00 PM",
      "text": "Leaving"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "6:31 PM",
      "text": "Ok, i checked with ██ for you. You can say two Tigers offici██s went to █████████'s apartment to get the waiver signed."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "6:31 PM",
      "text": "And at no point did █████████ say \"no\" to the de██."
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Ron Colangelo",
      "time": "6:32 PM",
      "text": "Don't quote of us but that is how it transpired"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "6:32 PM",
      "text": "Ok, cool. Thank you"
    }
  ]
}